flowchart TD
    E[Error Event] --> W[Wound]
    W --> P[Adaptive Pressure<br/>freq × 0.4 + sev × 0.3 + impact × 0.3]

    P -->|pressure ≥ threshold| S[Scar]
    P -->|pressure &lt; threshold| D1[Discarded]

    S --> C[Emergent Capability]

    C --> U[Usage Simulation]
    U --> SC[Utility Score]
    SC --> ST{State Transition}

    ST -->|utility ≥ 0.8 &amp; uses ≥ 20| CON[CONSOLIDADA]
    ST -->|utility ≥ 0.5 &amp; uses ≥ 5| ACT[ACTIVA]
    ST -->|otherwise| NAC[NACIENTE]

    CON --> AU[Audit Trail]
    ACT --> AU
    NAC --> AU
    AU --> DB[(SQLite<br/>reproducible record)]
